{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 水库｜xz ↔ nz｜冻结研究配图重组\n\n**直接来源：** `00_研究建库冻结备份_2026-08-03` 所指向的原研究 Canvas。\n\n本文件只做五行重排：保留原编号、原名称、原参考图、原来源页；不重新研究、不另造一套图片证据。\n\n共 10 项。","x":-800,"y":-800,"width":1600,"height":480,"color":"2"},{"id":"group-yang","type":"group","label":"阳水 xz｜9项｜原研究配图","x":-980,"y":0,"width":1840,"height":2460,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-02","type":"text","text":"## 02｜轻羽碎刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/4-wispy-korean-bangs-for-long-hair.jpg?resize=830%2C1032&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":-900,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-19","type":"text","text":"## 19｜凌乱帘幕刘海\n\n![](https://therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/31-unstyled-curtain-bangs.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/curtain-bangs/)","x":-320,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-23","type":"text","text":"## 23｜S字中分八字刘海\n\n![](https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0582/4548/0610/t/3/assets/2-mj-1677835762840_1200x.jpg?v=1677835765)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://walkingonsunshine.sg/pages/perm-bundle)","x":260,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-40","type":"text","text":"## 40｜羽化斜扫刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/9tLofBVoyeCI9VIxLdTfYxQ9U1Q%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/GettyImages-1136501494-d1eb379b83ac4efa870f3d1d5c0b225d.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/side-swept-bangs-ideas-11903584)","x":-900,"y":880,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-44","type":"text","text":"## 44｜长纹理刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/1kbLnk2nwVKuzE1IWQangYOHlA4%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/CareyMulliganfringe-5e64b792b5b449b9b2025161e42feeff.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/celebrity-hairstyles-featuring-fringe-bangs-345692)","x":-320,"y":880,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-57","type":"text","text":"## 57｜斜长羽化刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1-elongated-feather-cut-bangs-with-bob.jpg?resize=500%2C514&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/feathered-bangs/)","x":260,"y":880,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-61","type":"text","text":"## 61｜长乱边羽化刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/6-long-side-swept-feathered-fringe-with-a-short-bob.jpg?resize=500%2C503&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/feathered-bangs/)","x":-900,"y":1660,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-86","type":"text","text":"## 86｜自然乱波刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/2-long-wavy-hair-with-bangs.jpg?resize=500%2C692&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/wavy-hair-with-bangs/)","x":-320,"y":1660,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-97","type":"text","text":"## 97｜Jean Shrimpton 60年代碎片刘海\n\n![](https://assets.vogue.com/photos/5a00bd56ccd12a538ccb42a8/master/w_2560%2Cc_limit/00-story-image-jean-shrimpton-blowout.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.vogue.com/article/jean-shrimpton-bombshell-blowout-rollers-tips-how-to)","x":260,"y":1660,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"group-yin","type":"group","label":"阴水 nz｜1项｜原研究配图","x":-980,"y":2680,"width":1840,"height":900,"color":"2"},{"id":"item-48","type":"text","text":"## 48｜生长弧形长刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/r3OR3LfjZEpq_gfdUtcZei8rlxg%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/GettyImages-21490414561-acd563d319f04842828a9fbabdf8a703.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/celebrity-hairstyles-featuring-fringe-bangs-345692)","x":-900,"y":2780,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"2"}],"edges":[{"id":"edge-title-yang","fromNode":"title","toNode":"group-yang"},{"id":"edge-title-yin","fromNode":"group-yang","toNode":"group-yin"}],"metadata":{"version":"